Package: powersifu
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tomas Pluharik <noreply@github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, power-profiles-daemon
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Homepage: https://github.com/tpluharik/powersifu
Description: tray-based Linux power-profile automation
 PowerSifu switches power profiles based on AC or battery state, runs
 recurring profile schedules, and gracefully stops configured same-user
 applications when selected profiles become active.
